      },
      "cml:operator": "during",
      "cml:premiseText": "(7) A notation included in the notice is cancelled by this subsection if: (a) the Integrity Commissioner concludes the investigation to which the notice relates; and (b) any criminal proceedings or civil penalty proceedings resulting from the investigation are commenced."
    },
